    "name": "SoftwareBrothers/adminjs-design-system",
    "descriptionZh": "AdminJS 后台面板底下的那套设计系统，README 说包里的组件可以脱离 AdminJS 内核单独用。它靠 styled-components 与 styled-system 撑着，主题通过 ThemeProvider 注入，仓库带 108 个发行版和一份 Storybook。",
    "takeawayZh": "yarn 装一套专给后台面板的设计系统",
    "noteZh": "README 首段写 This package consists of all DesignSystem components from AdminJS so you can use all of them outside the adminjs core.，并点名 styled-components 与 styled-system 两个底座。Installation 是 yarn add @adminjs/design-system，下一段说明必须用 ThemeProvider 包住并从包里取 theme，示例代码写 import { theme, Button, Box, Icon } from '@adminjs/design-system'。README 目录分 Installation、Changing theme、Changing particular components、Components、Bundled packages、Contribute、Storybook、License 几节。右侧 About 一句 DesignSystem on which AdminJS is based on，另有 Fork 38、Star 30、Releases 108（最新 v4.1.1）、Contributors 12，Languages 条写 TypeScript 99.4%。",
